{"id":"vod_bf_15128","vodId":"15128","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士Kabuto","name_cn":"假面骑士Kabuto","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-16/bbbbc0d43c2705a6c89c44b33a7e9315.jpg"},"summary":"RIDER KABUTO是幪面超人诞生35周年纪念作品，采用昔日昆虫(巨型甲虫角日语KABUTOMUSHI)的设计，配合如幪面超人555般充满金属机械感，当中新颖的战斗场面采用了有如Matrix的拍摄手法，大量CG增加了速度感及观感， KABUTO的技能及必杀，更显其更潇酒有型。　　故事讲述涉谷被掉下的宇宙硕石毁灭，七年后出现的宇宙生物WORM四处杀害人类，纵使日本特别组织ZECT出动也徒然，成员加贺美新知道只有开发的腰带能与宇宙生物匹敌，但给拥有静头脑且身手敏捷的天道总司，取得甲虫形态KABUTO ZECTOR的控制权变身幪面超人KABUTO把WORM打败。　　随着七年前与岩石掉下毁灭涉谷的宇宙生物WORM，基本形态为绿色的「蛹」，统一的外貌有一双手掩盖面孔，遇见过的人类便能模拟对方面貌、行为及声音，在人类社会杀害及侵略活动，纵使ZECT军事武器也未能使WORM损伤。从「蛹」进化脱皮为成虫，而外貌变化各有不同，活动及破坏能力也大大提升，并可进行超越人类感知能力的加速运动性，此现象被称为「CLOCK UP」。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 21:58:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":49,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiamianqishiKabuto/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiamianqishiKabuto/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiamianqishiKabuto/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiamianqishiKabuto/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiamianqishiKabuto/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiamianqishiKabuto/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiamianqishiKabuto/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiamianqishiKabuto/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiamianqishiKabuto/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiamianqishiKabuto/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiamianqishiKabuto/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"h